1
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,370
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:39,350
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 17=

3
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,200
I called everyone in today
on short notice

4
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:44,720
because I have an announcement to make.

5
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,720
Ms. Wen Wanqing,

6
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:49,540
for her outstanding performance

7
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,680
in the divorce and asset division case,

8
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,840
and her excellent record

9
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,840
of consecutive wins over the past year,

10
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:57,460
has been unanimously approved
by the partners' meeting.

11
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:58,520
Effective immediately,

12
00:00:58,640 --> 00:00:59,520
Wen Wanqing

13
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,800
is promoted to

14
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,940
senior partner of our firm.

15
00:01:06,590 --> 00:01:07,710
(Notice of Appointment)

16
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:09,920
Thank you.

17
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,400
That's all. Meeting adjourned.

18
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:20,660
That's our Ms. Wen!

19
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,280
Thriving in both career and love.

20
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,960
You've got it all!

21
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:25,240
Oh, stop.

22
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:26,560
Dinner's on me sometime.

23
00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:28,200
I'll order something pricey.

24
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:28,860
Go ahead.

25
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:29,940
Anything.

26
00:01:30,710 --> 00:01:34,750
(Buyan Law Firm)

27
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:57,940
Congrats on your promotion, Ms. Wen!

28
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:03,140
Put me down! I'm dizzy!

29
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,840
How did you know?

30
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,620
Chen tipped you off, right?

31
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:26,680
I've got good news.

32
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:29,740
Xiaoyu's fully recovered.

33
00:02:30,160 --> 00:02:31,700
You won her case.

34
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:32,960
The contractor paid up.

35
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:33,980
Surgery went well too.

36
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,200
In the afternoon,

37
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:36,680
she can be discharged.

38
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:37,660
Really?

39
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:40,980
I'll get my things.

40
00:02:40,980 --> 00:02:42,000
Let's go see Xiaoyu.

41
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:42,760
Okay, let's go.

42
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,220
Come on.

43
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,020
Xiaoyu.

44
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:53,200
Look what we brought you.

45
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,320
Thank you, Dr. Pei.

46
00:02:55,660 --> 00:02:56,740
You're welcome.

47
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,320
Ms. Wen. Dr. Pei.

48
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:00,040
I was just going to bring her

49
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:01,660
to thank you in person.

50
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:04,180
We owe you both so much.

51
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,760
I told you!

52
00:03:06,760 --> 00:03:09,440
The pretty lady is his girlfriend.

53
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,760
Daddy didn't believe me.

54
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,880
Said I was talking nonsense.

55
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:14,240
I wasn't!

56
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,560
Are you all better now?

57
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:20,040
Yes! I can eat three bowls of rice!

58
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,340
Wow!

59
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,160
Keep eating well

60
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,720
and grow up strong, okay?

61
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,120
Pretty lady,

62
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,720
you two be happy too.

63
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:32,640
We will.

64
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,240
Want some cake?

65
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,880
We'll open it for you.

66
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,360
Let me do it. Which flavor do you like?

67
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,560
(We're still not official.)

68
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,120
(No confession.)

69
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:04,580
(No "Let's be together.")

70
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:07,040
(But I'm happy now.)

71
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:10,280
(Maybe "I love you")

72
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,380
(doesn't have to be said out loud.)

73
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:27,080
I need to take this.

74
00:04:39,140 --> 00:04:39,660
Hello?

75
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,240
I know.

76
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:52,700
Let's stick to the plan.

77
00:04:55,340 --> 00:04:56,700
I don't want her finding out.

78
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:43,990
(International Surgical
Medical Research Center)

79
00:05:43,990 --> 00:05:45,370
(cordially invites Dr. Pei Yiqiu
to the Global Exchange Program)

80
00:05:45,370 --> 00:05:46,660
(This program is designed to
foster collaboration,)

81
00:05:46,660 --> 00:05:47,990
(promote surgical innovation exchange,
and advance excellence in patient care)

82
00:05:56,790 --> 00:05:59,850
(Nielsen's Fairy Tale Illustrations
in Full Color)

83
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,400
What's wrong?

84
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:27,320
Pei Yiqiu.

85
00:06:28,980 --> 00:06:31,940
Is there anything you want to tell me?

86
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,080
No.

87
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,480
Why?

88
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:37,500
Nothing.

89
00:06:37,900 --> 00:06:39,060
Just curious.

90
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:44,520
Your favorite pork rib
and coix seed soup is almost ready.

91
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:45,740
Go sit down.

92
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:47,600
Go on.

93
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,360
I'll handle it.

94
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:06,480
(Integrity and Expert Care)

95
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,940
Ms. Wen?

96
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,160
Here to see Dr. Pei?

97
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,500
You know me?

98
00:07:10,590 --> 00:07:11,680
(Jiangcheng Affiliated Hospital)

99
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,360
Dr. Pei

100
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,520
looks at your photo on his desk
every day.

101
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,660
How could I not?

102
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:20,860
He just went in to operate.

103
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:23,420
(Integrity and Expert Care)
It may take a while.

104
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,280
Maybe you could sit down
and wait for him.

105
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:25,960
Dr. Chen.

106
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:27,580
I'm not here to see him.

107
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:29,200
I'm here to see you.

108
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:31,560
Me?

109
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,580
I'd like to ask you something.

110
00:07:35,640 --> 00:07:36,420
Has he

111
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,180
received an invitation

112
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:40,040
to an exchange program abroad?

113
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:43,700
So,

114
00:07:44,180 --> 00:07:45,060
you know about it?

115
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:48,520
Yes.

116
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:51,840
It's a top program in our field.

117
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:54,060
Two years, fully funded.

118
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:55,500
There are

119
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:56,460
very few spots.

120
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,360
Receiving that invitation

121
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,120
is the highest recognition

122
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,820
of Dr. Pei's abilities.

123
00:08:01,820 --> 00:08:04,000
So many here wish they could go.

124
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,560
It's strange, though.

125
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:08,200
Such a great opportunity,

126
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:10,080
and he just turned it down.

127
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:11,540
I asked him why,
but he wouldn't tell me.

128
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:13,380
Isn't that foolish?

129
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:40,310
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
